{"id":"n60489-1-13","stage":1,"title":"달력 · 日历","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60489-1-13-1","ko":"저기 달력에 크게 동그라미 친 날은 무슨 날이야?","zh":"日历上画了大圈的那天是什么日子？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里、那儿（指日历上的位置）","explanation":"저기：那里、那儿（指日历上的位置）","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"달력에","meaning":"日历","explanation":"달력：日历；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"달력","audio":"/audio/965833d955bd6c16d185.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60489","senseId":"1","lemma":"달력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달력에","audio":"/audio/3f6d1f4f190e7b26e3d8.mp3"}},{"text":"크게","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"크게","audio":"/audio/39efead98c7d3ec847e3.mp3"}},{"text":"동그라미","meaning":"圆，圆圈","explanation":"동그라미：圆，圆圈","readings":[{"term":"동그라미","audio":"/audio/d110cb250c186f31b2dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14794","senseId":"1","lemma":"동그라미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동그라미","audio":"/audio/d110cb250c186f31b2dc.mp3"}},{"text":"친","meaning":"画","explanation":"치다：画；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79090","senseId":"1","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친","audio":"/audio/297da9c1b1b603d9c530.mp3"}},{"text":"날은","meaning":"日子","explanation":"날：日子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryI